  "description": "Database-neutral SQL migration engine for EF-free (NativeAOT) Elarion hosts (ADR-0060): embedded V{version}__/R__ script discovery, SHA-256 checksums over line-ending-normalized content, out-of-order and repeatable planning, and the roll-forward execution model (history rows commit with their script — no repair command, no failed-row limbo). Drives a database provider through the IMigrationDatabase seam and the neutral AddElarionMigrations over an IMigrationDatabaseFactory a provider registers (Elarion.Sql.PostgreSql, Elarion.Sql.Sqlite). Contains no database driver.",
